+
+// ── 14 · BOTH SIDES OF THE EDGE (pass-5 critic, the thin-lap cure's price) ─────────────────────
+test('14 · both sides of the sheet edge: inside reaches no cell, below reaches the cell, and the 1–3px band is pinned', async ({
+  browser,
