+// The row is arm-agnostic: whatever the arm decides on a FRESH open at the new size is what the
+// open sheet must read once the resize has come to rest. Two cells: two at the table, opened at
+// 390×860 where the chart laps nothing (the yield's cell: it keeps the chart there and must give it
+// up at 390×664), and three at the table, opened at 390×1000 (the chart arm's cell: three rows
